PR #30 'Port OpenCode tched_router migration onto main' (repo repr0bated/operation-dbus-proto, Rust workspace).

Group 3: op-grpc-bridge and LLM consumers rewired from state_plugins::zeroclaw to TchedRouterState.catalog. gRPC pipeline: per-plugin surface generated from schema.methods; dynamic reflection hydrates from sealed SHM blobs named <plugin_id>.<hash16>.blob; dispatch must route through D-Bus PluginService.CallMethod. Watch for: inconsistent tched_router/zeroclaw fallbacks across lookups of the same datum, wrong catalog field access, reflection breaking on a pre-reseal host where only the zeroclaw blob exists, D-Bus bypasses.

